        "TileImage": "$($repository 9b0d0651-4f81-40e5-bf2a-5aec6fd763a5).Image",
        "Description": "The New York Bank account that financed the kidnapping of Craig Stewart was also used in several other huge transactions. One transaction traces to US Army Colonel Edward Mendez and another traces to Kronstadt Industries CEO Robert Knox. Both of them are based in Miami, Florida and are closely acquainted. They used corporate and military assets to remove Craig from Berlin and send him to a location in Japan. They will pay with their lives.",
